[en.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_ORNITHIA]
Friendship with Ornithia

[en.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_ORNITHIA_desc]
To develop friendship with Ornithia, we need to change our inward-looking status first: we need more ports and more docks.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_ORNITHIA]
与奥尼西亚的友谊

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_ORNITHIA_desc]
为发展与奥尼西亚王国的友谊，我们需要首先对我们的内陆封闭状态进行改变：我们需要更多的港口与更多的船坞。

